{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24194","headline":"晚春闲居杨工部寄诗杨常州寄茶同到因以长句荅之 · 白居易","name":"晚春闲居杨工部寄诗杨常州寄茶同到因以长句荅之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿酲寂寞眠初起，春意阑珊日又斜。\n劝我加餐因早笋，恨人休醉是残花。\n闷吟工部新来句，渴饮毗陵远到茶。\n兄弟东西官职冷，门前车马向谁家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}